Error [jet.NestedOptional]: `??` isn't allowed on a type
  --> tests/ui/type_double_optional.jet:1:32
    |
  1 | first: fn(values: [Int]) -> Int?? {
    |                                ^^
 Why: An optional value is written `T?` once; there is no optional optional
 Fix: Use a single `?`, like `Int?`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0309
